  "instructions": {
    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "templateVersion": "0.53.0",
    "database": [
      "Start from fully migrated and synchronized 1.0.0 (template 0.52.0). Rehearse on a private copy. Pause writers and back up the database, media, configuration, project files and served output together. Run the explicit migration check using pnpm db:migrate with the Compose API and dispatcher stopped, pnpm cf:db:migrate for local D1, or lace db migrate --target cloudflare-remote with the intended operator environment. Expect zero new ledger entries."
    ],
    "configuration": [
      "Review and apply the managed template plan, preserve operator overrides and use matching 1.1.0 packages and images. Keep the existing database and object store. Check configuration, original sign-in, content and media.",
      "Cloudflare operators can optionally add the IMAGES binding to worker/wrangler.jsonc and redeploy. Update the site's SDK and Astro packages after deploying the CMS, then rebuild. Restore the coordinated 1.0.0 project, runtime, database, media and site backup if the cutover fails."
    ]
  },
